James Rising received an inquiry from Ella Queenda Afful regarding her application to the Marine Policy program at the University of Delaware for Spring or Fall 2027. Ella expressed strong interest in his research on climate change's economic impacts and the water-energy-food nexus. She highlighted her background in rural-urban migration research, international trade impacts, and professional experience in climate-related policy initiatives. James drafted a professional response thanking her for her interest, acknowledging the alignment of her proposed research with his work, but regretting that he would not be able to take on any new students in the upcoming cycle. He encouraged her to explore other faculty members whose research aligns with her interests, wishing her success in her application process.
